  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0b4fffdf-0572-4a37-a55b-7216d6b62a33",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "content": "## Demo 10 — 多代理協作系統（Orchestrator Pattern）\n\n**目的**：Orchestrator 協調多個專門代理協作解決問題\n\n**架構**\n```\n使用者輸入\n  ↓\n  Orchestrator（決策大腦）\n  ├─ Tool A: 網路診斷代理\n  ├─ Tool B: 系統資源代理\n  └─ Tool C: 安全事件代理\n  ↓\n  整合發現，生成綜合報告\n```\n\n**使用前**：先啟動三個 Sub-Agent workflows（Active ON）\n\n**Demo 步驟**\n1. Open chat → 輸入 IT 事件\n2. 觀察 Orchestrator 呼叫了哪些專門代理\n3. 看最終整合報告"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bfb336ee-8c43-4065-a317-70127457d78f",
      "name": "Chat Trigger",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        280,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "title": "Demo 10：IT 維運多代理協作系統",
          "inputPlaceholder": "描述 IT 問題，例如：BGP down + CPU 過高，影響 Fab-12"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "e1f10136-1dd2-4439-88fc-554d451249e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "75c2f2bd-0e02-48c2-85ef-18c1c5874a98",
      "name": "Orchestrator：任務協調器",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        500,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "toolsAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是 TSMC IT 維運多代理協作系統的 Orchestrator。\n\n三個專門代理可呼叫：\n1. 網路診斷代理：BGP/OSPF/VLAN/介面問題\n2. 系統資源代理：CPU/Memory/Disk/Process 問題\n3. 安全事件代理：異常存取/權限/安全問題\n\n策略：根據事件類型判斷要呼叫哪個代理（可多個），整合所有發現生成完整報告。\n\n語言：繁體中文"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "039fc378-7f1b-4993-894c-f6ba8a5d1e16",
